# The first seeded, replayable Beyond Zork line anywhere, as far
# as it goes. The hero is built by hand on the arrow-driven
# Character Setup screen -- the .accept <key> tokens pressing the
# same §3.8.4 codes a keyboard would -- to the walkthrough's
# recipe: 9 points into Intelligence (enough for the first
# scroll), the rest split evenly. Base attributes start at 1, so
# the gauges land on 18/18/18/10.

# Two enters page the intro; three downs walk the menu from
# "Begin using a preset character" to "Create your own character".
